WEBVTT

00:07:59.164 --> 00:08:01.667
And it turns out that you
can solve this problem

00:08:01.691 --> 00:08:05.497
by etching the image of a fly
in the back of the urinal.

00:08:05.521 --> 00:08:09.420
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:08:09.444 --> 00:08:10.780
And it makes perfect sense.

00:08:10.804 --> 00:08:12.407
(Laughter)

00:08:12.431 --> 00:08:14.100
If I see a fly,

00:08:14.124 --> 00:08:15.363
I'm gonna get that fly.

00:08:15.387 --> 00:08:18.759
(Laughter)

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:21.262
That fly is going down.

00:08:21.286 --> 00:08:22.857
(Laughter)

00:08:22.881 --> 00:08:26.352
Now, this naturally begs the question
that if men can aim,

00:08:26.376 --> 00:08:28.868
why were they peeing
on the floor in the first place?

00:08:28.892 --> 00:08:31.156
In fact, if they were going
to pee on the floor,